  "text": "### Handling Objections  \n**Objection: \"Your rates sound high, are they really?\"**\n**Response:** \"Yes, they're among the best available. Compare us to Chase (4.35%), Santander (4.50%), and Chip (4.40%). We consistently rank in the top 3.\"  \n**Objection: \"What if rates drop?\"**\n**Response:** \"Our rates will drop with the Bank of England, just like everyone's. But our 2.5% margin guarantees we stay competitive.\"  \n**Objection: \"I'm happy with my current bank.\"**\n**Response:** \"That's great. But consider opening a SmartSaver with us — you can keep your main account elsewhere and earn better interest here.\"  \n**Objection: \"What if I need to close my account?\"**\n**Response:** \"No problem. You can close anytime with no penalty. We'll transfer your balance to your new bank.\"  \n---",
